  "limitations": "This is ONE physical Linux CI host and four namespaces, NOT independent failure domains or production gateway HA. A single gateway cut demonstrates fallback for a fresh client to the surviving gateway; a dual cut can fail during client startup BEFORE delivery to any grain. Neither cut proves an in-flight ACK was lost after COMMIT. SQL remains healthy; no transaction is allowed to commit during a confirmed full gateway cut. The identical operation ID is committed once AFTER restoring both gateways and replayed idempotently. Does not prove multi-host HA, fencing, RTO, sustained TPS, end-to-end costs or mainframe MIPS."
